    {
      "id": 36,
      "title": "Wasted Tokens & Cost",
      "description": "Tokens that bought nothing: generated on streams that got aborted, plus the full output of any generation whose tool call was rejected (guard block, your manual rejection, or a rule denial) - attributed to the generation that made the rejected call, never counted twice. Shown absolute (B/M/K), as a share of all completion tokens, and the dollars spent on them.",
